WEBVTT

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:38.920
Huh?

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:40.110
Huh?!

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:44.830
Suigin!

00:01:46.670 --> 00:01:48.270
Are you okay, Suigin?

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:49.960
Ow...

00:01:55.760 --> 00:02:00.770
<b>Aslan's Trial</b>

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:03.050
It appears that there's no mistake...

00:02:03.050 --> 00:02:05.220
You're Riku Suigin, aren't you?

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:10.860
What the hell? No one makes an 
appearance like that nowadays.

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:14.230
Be careful, Suigin. She's strong.

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:15.030
Huh?

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:19.680
Riku Suigin, the boss told me
 not to come see you,

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:21.890
but I don't care.

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:25.160
I'm sure you want to see <i>her</i>.

00:02:26.320 --> 00:02:28.000
Evil Mirror, manifest.

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:32.810
What? A mirror?

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:40.170
There's someone there.

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:43.970
Riku Rei...

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.960
I've wanted to see you so badly...

00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:59.910
Riku Rei, it's Suigin! Can you hear me?

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:03.580
I'm coming to save you! Where are you?

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:06.580
Tell me where you are!

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:09.670
Answer me! Can't you hear me?

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:10.630
Riku Rei!

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:17.140
Riku Rei! Riku Rei!

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:23.240
Riku Rei...

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.950
Riku Rei, are you all right?

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.800
They haven't done anything 
awful to you, have they?

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:34.430
I'll come rescue you from 
there, no matter what.

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:36.900
Just hang on a little longer.

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:39.660
I'll come for you!

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:43.290
I'm sure Maki-chan's worried 
since I suddenly disappeared.

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:47.650
I haven't contacted the school, 
so now I'm behind in my studies.

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:51.140
I'm still in the middle of sorting 
all of my father's belongings...

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:53.270
Riku Rei, are you listening?

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:57.590
So many things have happened since then!

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:58.340
Riku Rei!

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:00.520
Where are you going, Riku Rei?!

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:01.380
Riku Rei!

00:04:02.980 --> 00:04:04.190
Suigin?

00:04:04.190 --> 00:04:05.910
Is that really you, Suigin?! {M: uh...}

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:08.620
Riku Rei! I'm right here!

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:10.470
I'm coming to save you right now!

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:15.520
That's enough. Did you enjoy 
being reunited with her?

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:21.480
Boss said that you're quite the 
player, but I don't believe it.

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:24.200
Show me yourself.

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:26.330
What are you doing?!

00:04:27.190 --> 00:04:28.120
Suigin!

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.140
I'm fine, Farin.

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:37.190
So you're Nishikaze, the player the guy on 
the phone said I should find.

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:38.980
I'm glad I don't have to look for you anymore.

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:43.130
What are you guys after? Release Riku Rei!

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:45.130
Amazing, Suigin.

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:47.530
Yes, I'm Nishikaze.

00:04:47.530 --> 00:04:52.350
I just attacked you to test the 
strength of your Divine Tomb Item.

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:54.600
Hey, guys! Where did the boss go?

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:55.680
No idea.

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:58.160
He's so strong!

00:04:58.160 --> 00:05:01.650
Be careful. We might not get very 
far with our current equipment.

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:03.120
Yeah, I know.

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:12.460
All of your blood... 
is not the blood I seek.

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:15.680
He's too strong!

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:16.620
Run away!

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:17.450
Save me!

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:21.660
Weaklings. I have no 
interest in any of you.

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:23.940
I'll take care of all you at once.

00:05:24.710 --> 00:05:27.410
Take this... My summoning attack.

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:29.880
I'm sure you won't be disappointed.

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:32.000
Slash kai!

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:35.930
Demons in the sea of blood, show yourselves.

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:38.110
Hey, look down.

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:38.740
Huh?

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:40.320
What the heck is this?

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:42.200
There's something in there.

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:43.320
Be careful.

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:44.780
We're going with formation D.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:50.620
I've seen this a movie before.

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:51.930
What's gonna happen?

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:54.420
We end up looking down and then 
something comes from above...

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:55.720
Or not...

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:56.920
Save me!

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.520
What the hell is that?!

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:03.710
It's a monster!

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:12.310
They are my servants... The Mosquito Legion.

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:16.980
It'll suck all of you dry.

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:25.700
Any player who's pierced by the Mosquito 
Legion will turn into a drop of blood,

00:06:27.200 --> 00:06:31.000
then that blood will merge 
with me and become bone.

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:37.950
Now, go. Suck them all dry so 
they will become part of me.

00:06:37.950 --> 00:06:40.970
Let's protect this final tomb together!

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:43.970
Run! This festival was a trap! Damn it!

00:06:49.590 --> 00:06:55.170
No... The blood that I'm searching for 
doesn't exist in any of these droplets.

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:56.600
Where could it be?

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:59.190
There's someone over there.

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:01.850
This wave... It has to be...

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:07.370
I see. Now I was able to 
see it with my own eyes.

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:09.210
That's Riku Yuuki's wave.

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:11.190
I have a message from Boss.

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:16.040
After confirming your Buster Item, 
you should head to Stage 0.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:19.880
I heard that Stage 0 
was opening up in five days...

00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:23.590
That rumor was a lie. 
You can enter if you have the key.

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:29.180
This is the wave.

00:07:29.890 --> 00:07:32.420
This is the blood I've been longing for.

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:34.810
I've found you, Riku Suigin.

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:41.930
What was that?

00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:45.930
What is this?

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:51.140
I've been waiting for you 
for a very long time.

00:07:51.140 --> 00:07:52.650
Huh? For me?

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:56.190
Follow you. Fulfill the mission.

00:07:56.620 --> 00:08:00.100
That was the order which I was given.

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:01.390
What do you mean?

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:03.640
Take this.

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:07.340
Your blood will activate that key.

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:11.190
Chosen One, use this key to enter Stage 0.

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:16.780
Then all of your memories 
of Stage 0 will reawaken.

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:21.120
But in order for that to happen, 
you must undergo the final test.

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:22.810
What the?

00:08:36.970 --> 00:08:40.870
What's going on? That's completely 
different from that boss.

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:44.490
This is Aslan's ultimate form.

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:47.060
Bloody Buddha.

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:49.340
Hey, look!

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:51.230
I've never seen anything like that!

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:01.060
What is that? Something just 
appeared in the boss's stomach.

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:04.430
Riku Suigin, do you know what this is?

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:07.580
That's... Could it be Aslan's vital point?

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:10.560
If you destroy that core, 
you'll be able to defeat Aslan.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:13.890
You are correct, little girl.

00:09:13.890 --> 00:09:15.710
But that's not all.

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:21.980
Riku Yuuki ordered part of Riku Suigin's 
memories to be sealed in here.

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:26.180
<i>That stupid weird old man.</i>

00:09:26.180 --> 00:09:29.390
<i>He seriously sealed some of my 
memories in that boss's stomach...</i>

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:31.850
I'm sure it's your origins.

00:09:31.850 --> 00:09:33.170
If they were just memories,

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:36.210
I'm sure Riku Yuuki would've told you 
about them before he died.

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:41.690
Well, I do have many things 
that I can't remember, so...

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:46.850
Aslan, I'm gonna take back the memories 
that the old man sealed away.

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:49.730
Suigin...

00:09:50.090 --> 00:09:51.690
Raven Scarf, activate.

00:09:52.280 --> 00:09:54.780
<i>Seven different gems 
with seven different abilities</i>

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:56.490
<i>will appear from this Tomb Item...</i>

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:58.380
<i>They randomly shuffle 
through when activated.</i>

00:09:58.650 --> 00:10:02.740
<i>I'm still unsure which color does what...</i>

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:05.830
<i>Please... be something powerful.</i>

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:07.630
<i>Huh? This is...</i>

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:09.120
Riku Suigin,

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:13.550
show me the true powers of him 
becoming a Tomb Item!

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:17.240
Look! Something happened up there!

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:19.070
Someone's fighting with the boss.

00:10:19.070 --> 00:10:20.680
Does he plan to die?

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:24.240
Is Suigin okay?

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:27.440
Whether he's okay or not 
is all up to his fate.

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:31.350
Oh? You're still alive.

00:10:32.180 --> 00:10:35.970
Armed Skill: Raven Blade.

00:10:37.390 --> 00:10:42.740
A sword is useless against my body 
that can regenerate endlessly!

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:46.240
This is no ordinary blade.

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:52.670
Not only is it sharp, it triples my speed.

00:10:53.070 --> 00:10:55.590
It doesn't give my opponent time 
to even take a break.

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:16.860
He's trying to use the blood droplets 
to regenerate again.

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:20.070
Before that happens, 
I'm going to defeat you, Aslan.

00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:42.970
<i>This armor is way harder 
than I thought it'd be.</i>

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:45.270
<i>This blade isn't enough.</i>

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:53.580
<i>It looks like defeating Aslan 
is going to be tougher than I thought.</i>

00:11:53.570 --> 00:11:58.570
<b>The Final Countdown</b>

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:07.490
You damaged my arms and 
legs so I couldn't move...

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:11.200
Then, to try to finish me off, 
you attacked my head.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:15.970
You don't get it, Riku Suigin. 
As long as I'm in this sea of blood,

00:12:15.970 --> 00:12:17.690
I am invincible.

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:24.680
All of the damage you do to me
 will just make me stronger!

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:29.440
I see... Not only can you regenerate with 
the droplets of blood from the other players,

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:31.400
but you can become bigger.

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:39.360
Does that mean Aslan is made from 
our blood, sweat, and tears?

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:40.280
Yes.

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:42.670
What's the matter, Riku Suigin?

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:46.590
If you're not going to make a move, 
I'll just have to go first!

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:50.740
<i>Seriously? He can shoot plasma, too?!</i>

00:12:57.960 --> 00:13:02.270
<i>Not only did he get bigger, the power 
of his attacks has multiplied, too.</i>

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:06.260
<i>Right now, he's way more powerful than I am.</i>

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:08.830
<i>Can I even win against him?</i>

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:10.910
<i>No... There's still a chance!</i>

00:13:29.310 --> 00:13:31.720
Now you can't use your precious, little sword.

00:13:33.750 --> 00:13:38.080
It's way too hard to try to 
damage Aslan in this situation.

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:43.900
But I might be able to last a 
little longer with these attacks.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:47.720
What's that strange symbol?

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:52.680
Those who are chosen by me 
will receive this symbol.

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:55.290
This is my Snow Lotus.

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:59.370
This flower will gradually wilt for 80 seconds.

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:03.860
During that time, I will gain 
control of the blood in your body.

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:11.530
Once it finishes wilting, all of the blood 
will burst from your body and you will die.

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:13.370
My blood will burst?!

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:19.670
However, if you're able to steal 
my core within 80 seconds,

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:23.380
you will be released from the curse.

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:26.270
If you win, you win.

00:14:26.270 --> 00:14:30.350
If you lose, you will 
shatter just like your sword.

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:35.620
This is...

00:14:39.860 --> 00:14:41.260
I see...

00:14:41.260 --> 00:14:42.760
Eighty seconds...

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:47.150
That's exactly the amount of time 
I thought I'd need to defeat you.

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:54.760
What's that smoke coming from his sword?

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:58.300
It immediately engulfed this whole field.

00:14:58.300 --> 00:15:01.630
That sword's true power isn't to cut.

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:03.490
Hey, what's this smoke?

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:06.520
I'm feeling better suddenly.

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:11.680
Hey, Aslan. Could you show me
 your ultimate attack?

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:14.920
Do you want to die so quickly?

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:20.160
Does he understand all of his 
assets will be gone if he loses?

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:26.140
But he seems really confident, so maybe 
he's figured out how to clear this level.

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:30.740
Very well. I will show 
you my ultimate attack!

00:15:31.380 --> 00:15:33.760
Bloody Hell Crimson Dragon!

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:39.210
This blood dragon that I've summoned will 
rise to the heavens and bring about a storm!

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:45.390
<i>That dragon... is swirling 
up towards the sky.</i>

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:49.270
<i>So it basically works like a tornado.</i>

00:15:49.270 --> 00:15:52.970
<i>The closer you get to the center, 
the calmer the storm will be.</i>

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:09.490
<i>The crimson dragon separated from Aslan?</i>

00:16:09.490 --> 00:16:11.480
It's no use.

00:16:11.480 --> 00:16:15.790
He can't do this alone! 
We're going to help him defeat the boss!

00:16:15.790 --> 00:16:17.470
Yeah!

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:21.750
You foolish grave robbers...

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:27.810
All right! He can't move now! {M: He ...can't??}

00:16:29.490 --> 00:16:31.470
You can continue to try, 
but the result will be the same.

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:35.480
Have you forgotten that I can regenerate?

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:38.940
Once the crimson dragon completely rises,

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:41.900
that will be the sign that 
this attack is ready.

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:45.190
This is my final attack...

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:46.900
Crimson Dragon Blast!

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:06.920
Ah, so you're still alive.

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:11.450
But I'm disappointed in you, Riku Suigin.

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:14.380
You cannot become a tomb 
guardian at that rate.

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:19.100
There's nothing I could've done. 
Your attack was too strong.

00:17:20.190 --> 00:17:22.440
You admit your failure?

00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:28.100
I'm just stating the truth. 
I can't win fighting you head-on.

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:30.120
Do whatever you want.

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:34.100
You still have time before 
your 80 seconds is up,

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:38.660
but tomb guardians that I do not 
acknowledge will fall to a single blow.

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:39.620
Suigin!

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:40.870
The fight's been decided.

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:43.840
Three, two, one...

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:44.680
Zero.

00:17:47.250 --> 00:17:48.750
Riku Suigin...

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:50.460
What have you...

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:52.820
What have you done to me?

00:18:09.030 --> 00:18:11.800
Aslan, you've lost.

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:15.240
Why? Why can't my body regenerate?

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:23.890
When I saw my blade, I knew
 I couldn't beat you head-on.

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:27.770
But it's a weapon that came 
from my Gramps's Raven Scarf.

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:29.830
I knew there had to be something more.

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:32.960
When the blade broke, I realized it...

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:37.130
What? When it broke? 
You mean when the smoke appeared?

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:39.060
Highly concentrated oxygen.

00:18:39.060 --> 00:18:43.600
That's why Suigin's powers increased and 
the other players also felt better.

00:18:43.600 --> 00:18:46.850
The source of Aslan's powers is blood.

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:50.320
Which means that he's full of iron.

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:56.480
And if that body is pumped full of oxygen,
 Aslan's powers will briefly increase,

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:59.690
but it'll also react with the 
iron and make his body rust.

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:04.250
Because the blade broke, 
the oxygen spread even more.

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:09.250
That's why highly concentrated 
oxygen engulfed the field quickly.

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:13.760
Right. That's my Gramps's Divine 
Tomb Weapon, the Raven Blade.

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:20.000
When did you inject all 
of that oxygen into me?

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:23.690
Good point. Even if Suigin attacked Aslan,

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:25.730
those wounds wouldn't have been enough.

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:28.210
But I can't think of anything else.

00:19:28.210 --> 00:19:30.660
Inconceivable. That is not possible.

00:19:31.660 --> 00:19:36.720
If that had been the case I would have begun to rust when I was damaged,

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:39.650
but that didn't happen.

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:44.570
You did something special while 
I wasn't looking, didn't you?

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:47.000
Nothing special, really.

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:51.440
I could only apply minimal 
damage with this sword.

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:53.550
The cuts wouldn't even be that big.

00:19:53.930 --> 00:19:57.500
You can repeatedly heal 
yourself from that damage,

00:19:57.790 --> 00:20:01.710
but your blood splatter would start to rust...

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:05.500
The way you regenerate is with 
other players' blood droplets.

00:20:06.270 --> 00:20:08.400
I created an oxygen field,

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:11.280
so all of those droplets also 
had a lot of oxygen in them.

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:15.130
The more you regenerated to strengthen yourself,

00:20:15.130 --> 00:20:16.770
the weaker you became.

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:21.610
But my body shouldn't break 
just because of that.

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:25.160
You used a plasma attack. 
That's what gave me the idea.

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:28.170
If you used an even more powerful attack,

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:31.040
this field would be covered 
in an electromagnetic wave.

00:20:31.550 --> 00:20:34.720
The huge amount of oxygen would 
undergo a chemical reaction,

00:20:34.720 --> 00:20:35.970
and become ozone.

00:20:37.180 --> 00:20:39.600
The blood within your body 
would also be affected,

00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:41.810
and your body would no longer 
be able to handle it.

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:46.690
Also, a chemical reaction 
happened inside your body,

00:20:46.690 --> 00:20:49.770
making it lose the necessary 
oxygen gradually.

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:52.390
Oxygen poisoning...

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:56.690
That's right. That's why your cells 
broke apart and became liquid.

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:59.900
You probably won't be able to regenerate 
in this condition for a while.

00:21:00.630 --> 00:21:03.670
Could you tell me how to use this now?

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:06.870
Take that to Stage 0 and you'll find out.

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:08.550
That guy's awesome.

00:21:08.550 --> 00:21:10.690
He defeated Aslan all by himself.

00:21:10.690 --> 00:21:12.800
He must be a Billion Player.

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:15.070
Let's invite him to our team.

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:16.470
Looks like I missed something exciting.

00:21:16.470 --> 00:21:18.610
Hey, who are they?

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:22.870
Th-Those masks...

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:23.930
It can't be!

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:26.060
Silverback!

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:33.940
<b>Next Time
The Door to Zero / A Reunion Through the Mirror</b>

00:23:30.330 --> 00:23:31.830
The Silver Guardian!
